<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#islamic_pig_taboo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In Islam, the consumption of pork is strictly prohibited (haram) as stated in the Quran. This religious prohibition is a core tenet of Islamic faith and is widely understood by Muslims. The stereotype that Muslims are associated with pigs is a direct violation of this religious principle and is used to mock or insult Muslims. The image uses this real-world religious knowledge to create a false and offensive association."@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#stereotype_muslims_pigs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stereotype: Muslims are associated with pigs or pig-like behavior"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#text_chunk_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "text content: 'muslims offend me', position: bottom center of image, white text with black outline, overlaid on the image."@en .
