<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#islamophobia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Islamophobia is the fear, hatred, or prejudice against Muslims, often based on stereotypes and misinformation. The meme is a clear example of Islamophobic content, as it uses a harmful stereotype to incite hatred and discrimination against Muslims. This concept is a real-world social phenomenon that the meme is directly referencing and exploiting."@en .
