<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01284#hate_meme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A hate meme is a type of internet meme that is designed to promote hatred, prejudice, or discrimination against a specific group. The image is a hate meme because it uses a harmful stereotype (Muslims = pigs) to incite hatred and discrimination against Muslims. This concept is a real-world phenomenon that the meme is directly referencing and exploiting."@en .
